name: factory

audience: team
description: >
  factory_core — a founder-owned, portable software-factory core. Generic by
  construction: it imports nothing target-specific, and it carries no consuming
  organization's data. Durable team-audience knowledge belongs to THIS
  repository and ships with it through .kin/knowledge.jsonl; it is never
  company-scoped memory.

domains:
